<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: IRA claim responsibility for UK motorway bombs.</title>
<headline>IRA claim responsibility for UK motorway bombs.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Irish Republican Army on Friday claimed responsibility for two bombs planted on motorways in central England which caused traffic chaos on Thursday.</p>
<p>The claim was made by someone using a recognised codeword who called the Dublin office of the Irish broadcasting corporation RTE, an RTE spokeswoman said.</p>
